@NLayerShop.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5135

### Create a category (201 + body + Location header)
POST {{NLayerShop.Api_HostAddress}}/api/categories
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Electronics"
}

### List categories (paged)
GET {{NLayerShop.Api_HostAddress}}/api/categories?page=1&size=20
Accept: application/json

### List products (paged, 1 <= size <= 100)
GET {{NLayerShop.Api_HostAddress}}/api/products?page=1&size=20
Accept: application/json

### Invalid paging -> 400 ValidationProblemDetails
GET {{NLayerShop.Api_HostAddress}}/api/products?page=0&size=101
Accept: application/json

### Get product by id (404 ProblemDetails if missing or soft-deleted)
GET {{NLayerShop.Api_HostAddress}}/api/products/1
Accept: application/json

### Create a product (201 + ProductDetailDto incl. rowVersion)
POST {{NLayerShop.Api_HostAddress}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Phone",
  "price": 999.90,
  "description": "Smartphone",
  "stockCount": 10,
  "categoryId": 1
}

### Invalid input -> 400 with errors dictionary
POST {{NLayerShop.Api_HostAddress}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "price": -1,
  "description": "x",
  "stockCount": -5,
  "categoryId": null
}

### Unknown (or soft-deleted) category -> 422 Business rule violation
POST {{NLayerShop.Api_HostAddress}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Orphan",
  "price": 1,
  "description": "x",
  "stockCount": 1,
  "categoryId": 9999
}

### Full replace (PUT): all fields required, categoryId null = no category.
### rowVersion must be the value from the last GET; reusing a stale one -> 409 Conflict
PUT {{NLayerShop.Api_HostAddress}}/api/products/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Phone v2",
  "price": 899.90,
  "description": "Smartphone",
  "stockCount": 8,
  "categoryId": null,
  "rowVersion": "AAAAAAAAB9E="
}

### Soft delete a product (204); it disappears from GET endpoints
DELETE {{NLayerShop.Api_HostAddress}}/api/products/1

### Soft delete a category (204); its products are kept but lose the category
DELETE {{NLayerShop.Api_HostAddress}}/api/categories/1

# ==================== Orders ====================
# Creating an order touches Orders + OrderItems + Products (stock) in ONE SaveChanges (Unit of Work).

### Create an order (201 + OrderDetailDto); stock of each product is decremented
POST {{NLayerShop.Api_HostAddress}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": [
    { "productId": 1, "quantity": 2 },
    { "productId": 2, "quantity": 1 }
  ]
}

### Insufficient stock -> 422, nothing is written (no order, no stock change)
POST {{NLayerShop.Api_HostAddress}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": [
    { "productId": 1, "quantity": 100000 }
  ]
}

### Empty items / quantity 0 / duplicate productId -> 400 ValidationProblemDetails
POST {{NLayerShop.Api_HostAddress}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": [
    { "productId": 1, "quantity": 0 },
    { "productId": 1, "quantity": 1 }
  ]
}

### Unknown (or soft-deleted) product -> 404
POST {{NLayerShop.Api_HostAddress}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": [
    { "productId": 9999, "quantity": 1 }
  ]
}

### List orders (paged, optional status filter: Pending | Completed | Cancelled)
GET {{NLayerShop.Api_HostAddress}}/api/orders?page=1&size=20&status=Pending
Accept: application/json

### Get order by id (items carry the name/price snapshot taken at order time)
GET {{NLayerShop.Api_HostAddress}}/api/orders/1
Accept: application/json

### Cancel a pending order (204); stocks are restored. Non-pending -> 422
POST {{NLayerShop.Api_HostAddress}}/api/orders/1/cancel

### Complete a pending order (204). Non-pending -> 422
POST {{NLayerShop.Api_HostAddress}}/api/orders/1/complete
